@startuml Vista de Processos – Level 3 (US 4.1.14 – Manage Complementary Task Categories)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
	ArrowColor Black
	ActorBorderColor #000000
	ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	LifeLineBorderColor Black
	LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	ParticipantBorderColor Black
	ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

participant "«container (C4)»\nSPA (Web UI)" as UI #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nComplementaryTaskCategoriesController" as CTC_CTRL #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nIComplementaryTaskCategoryRepository" as CTC_REPO #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nComplementaryTaskCategory" as CTC_DOMAIN #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nOEMDbContext" as DB_CTX #87CEEB
participant "«external»\nIAM" as IAM #F5F5DC

-> UI: 1: request to manage Complementary Task Categories
activate UI
UI -> IAM: 1.1: validate token (Port Operations Supervisor role)
activate IAM
IAM --> UI: 1.1.1: token valid
deactivate IAM

UI -> CTC_CTRL: 1.2: GET /api/complementarytaskcategories
activate CTC_CTRL
CTC_CTRL -> CTC_REPO: 1.2.1: GetAllAsync()
activate CTC_REPO
CTC_REPO --> CTC_CTRL: 1.2.2: list of categories
deactivate CTC_REPO
CTC_CTRL --> UI: 1.3: 200 OK (categories)
deactivate CTC_CTRL

UI --> : 1.4: display categories table
deactivate UI

-> UI: 2: create new category
activate UI
UI -> CTC_CTRL: 2.1: POST /api/complementarytaskcategories (CreateCategoryDTO)
activate CTC_CTRL

CTC_CTRL -> CTC_DOMAIN: 2.1.1: new ComplementaryTaskCategory(code, name, description, duration, impact)
activate CTC_DOMAIN
CTC_DOMAIN -> CTC_DOMAIN: 2.1.1.1: ValidateCode() [CTC###]
CTC_DOMAIN -> CTC_DOMAIN: 2.1.1.2: SetDefaultDuration(optional)
CTC_DOMAIN -> CTC_DOMAIN: 2.1.1.3: SetExpectedImpact(optional)
CTC_DOMAIN --> CTC_CTRL: 2.1.2: ComplementaryTaskCategory entity
deactivate CTC_DOMAIN

CTC_CTRL -> CTC_REPO: 2.1.3: AddAsync(category)
activate CTC_REPO
CTC_REPO -> DB_CTX: 2.1.3.1: Add(category)
activate DB_CTX
DB_CTX --> CTC_REPO: 2.1.3.2: saved
deactivate DB_CTX
CTC_REPO --> CTC_CTRL: 2.1.4: persisted
deactivate CTC_REPO

CTC_CTRL --> UI: 2.2: 201 Created
deactivate CTC_CTRL

UI --> : 2.3: display confirmation, update table
deactivate UI

@enduml
